  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></math></p><p>Now differentiation the above function,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Point of maxima and minima,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>And domain is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0084_36b3e53d827a.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 122px;\" /></p><p>So at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, maxima</p><p>The maximum value of the function,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>The minimum value of function at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>or</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Therefore, the range of the function,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>Range</mtext><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
